n\n$$\n‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖=\\sqrt{8 v^{2} + 1}.\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $f(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(u,v)) & =(- 4 x^{2} + y z)\\,{|}_{x=u\\,y=u + v\\,z=v^{2}} \\\\  & =-4\\cdot (u\\cdot u)+(u+v)\\cdot v^{2} \\\\  & =- 4 u^{2} + 1 \\left(u + v\\right) v^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,\\left(- 4 u^{2} + 1 \\left(u + v\\right) v^{2}\\right) \\sqrt{8 v^{2} + 1}\\,\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536040 17592186045443 true] [17592186560316 1080 "\\left(- 2 u^{3} + 2 u^{2} v^{2} + 6 u v\\right) \\sqrt{45 u^{2} + 144 u v^{2} + 144 v^{4} + 16 v^{2}}" 13194139536040 17592186045443 true] [17592186560316 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536040 17592186045443 true] [17592186560316 1083 #uuid "2dbbf8c5-b186-50e3-83eb-a34ac7c0c068" 13194139536040 17592186045443 true] [17592186560317 1080 "\\sqrt{8 v^{2} + 1} \\left(- 4 u^{2} - v^{3} + v^{2} \\left(u + v\\right)\\right)" 13194139536040 17592186045443 true] [17592186560317 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536040 17592186045443 true] [17592186560317 1083 #uuid "33bb8fed-592d-5e3a-8930-5d28957eefc1" 13194139536040 17592186045443 true] [17592186560318 1080 "\\sqrt{8 v^{2} + 1} \\left(- 4 u^{2} - 2 v^{3} + v^{2} \\left(u + v\\right)\\right)" 13194139536040 17592186045443 true] [17592186560318 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536040 17592186045443 true] [17592186560318 1083 #uuid "34bd55fd-9014-5837-a3ed-30210221cafa" 13194139536040 17592186045443 true] [17592186560319 1080 "\\left(2 u^{2} v^{2} + 6 u v\\right) \\sqrt{45 u^{2} + 144 u v^{2} + 144 v^{4} + 16 v^{2}}" 13194139536040 17592186045443 true] [17592186560319 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536040 17592186045443 true] [17592186560319 1083 #uuid "361ee39b-048e-5ba6-8456-29b75f167d20" 13194139536040 175921860454